{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026i9owYmOWvq1795215102.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>金價連跌第五日，再跌至十四個月低位。</p><p></p><p>紐約期金收市報3,515.4美元一盎司，跌170.1美元，跌幅百分之4.6。</p><p></p><p>現貨金價收市報3,538.49美元一盎司，跌86.98美元，跌幅百分之2.4。</p><p></p><p>全個星期計，金價跌了百分之8.9。High Ridge Futures金屬交易董事麥格認為，人工智能股份持續下跌，逼使部分投資者要沽出黃金填補損失。同時，高利率、強美元及預期通脹高企，推動聯儲局持續加息，所有因素都不利黃金市場。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T00:09:33.882418+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":212,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T22:50:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T00:57:12.848417+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T00:02:58.988379+00:00","content_hash":"47a8716c96a427f23829ecf2fcf999044e18abeae178a15d5be87035df99e6e0","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-21T00:09:33.882418+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}